Package: honupsy
Title: Tools for Working with Routine Psychiatric Patient Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Ketzer", , "michael.ketzer@unibas.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9633-3947"))
Description: Provides functions to import and summarise data from the Swiss national quality measurement in adult inpatient psychiatry. Descriptive summaries cover unit-level patient composition, symptom severity based on the Health of the Nation Outcome Scales (HoNOS), and unit occupancy, to support analyses of how patient composition relates to nurse staffing and workload.
